    "To take a profile picture, allow Secret DJ to use your camera in Settings.": {
      "comment": "Message body of the onboarding photo step's camera-permission alert, shown when camera access is denied or restricted.",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Um ein Profilbild aufzunehmen, erlaube Secret DJ den Kamerazugriff in den Einstellungen."
