            "value": "Gerade gibt es nichts zu kaufen — schau bald wieder vorbei."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Ahora mismo no hay nada que comprar — vuelve a mirar pronto."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Il n'y a rien à acheter pour le moment — reviens bientôt."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Er is nu niets te koop — kom snel terug."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sorry, we couldn't load the top-up options.\n\nPlease check that you have a good connection to your cellular data or WiFi network.": {
      "comment": "Body shown on the top-up screen when it fails to load.",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Sorry, wir konnten die Aufladeoptionen nicht laden.\n\nBitte prüfe, ob du eine gute Verbindung zu deinen mobilen Daten oder deinem WLAN hast."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Lo sentimos, no hemos podido cargar las opciones de recarga.\n\nComprueba que tienes una buena conexión a tus datos móviles o a la red WiFi."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Désolé, nous n'avons pas pu charger les options de recharge.\n\nVérifie que tu as une bonne connexion à tes données mobiles ou à ton réseau WiFi."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Sorry, we konden de opwaardeeropties niet laden.\n\nControleer of je een goede verbinding hebt met je mobiele data of wifi-netwerk."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sorry, that purchase failed.\n\nNo payment was taken.": {
      "comment": "Toast shown when a top-up purchase fails before any payment is taken — the SKU couldn't be resolved, or the App Store's own purchase sheet failed.",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Sorry, der Kauf ist fehlgeschlagen.\n\nEs wurde keine Zahlung abgebucht."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Lo sentimos, la compra ha fallado.\n\nNo se ha realizado ningún cargo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Désolé, l'achat a échoué.\n\nAucun paiement n'a été effectué."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
